  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如你所知，密阿雷市咖啡馆林立，\n竞争非常激烈。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F60624077E5FF0C5BC6963F96F75E0254965561998667977ACBFF0C000A7ADE4E89975E5E386FC070C8300200100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了开发能战胜竞争对手的新菜单，\n我关注的是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E865F0053D180FD621880DC7ADE4E895BF9624B768465B083DC5355FF0C000A621151736CE87684662F2026202600100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花椰猴！爆香猴！冷水猴！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82B169307334FF01720699997334FF0151B76C347334FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它们3只虽然长得很像，\n但特征却大不相同。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834EEC003353EA867D7136957F5F975F8850CFFF0C000A4F4672795F81537459274E0D76F8540C300200100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花椰猴头上的叶子\n有消除疲劳的效果！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82B16930733459344E0A768453F65B50000A67096D88966475B252B376846548679CFF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "爆香猴头上的毛发丛里\n燃烧着300度的火焰！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72069999733459344E0A76846BDB53D14E1B91CC000A71C370E777400033003000305EA67684706B7130FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冷水猴头上的毛发丛里\n储藏着营养丰富的水！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B76C34733459344E0A76846BDB53D14E1B91CC000A50A885CF77408425517B4E305BCC76846C34FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n滋身健体的叶子、充满营养的水\n以及温度绝佳的火，全都齐了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF0100100001BE01000A6ECB8EAB50654F53768453F65B50300151456EE18425517B76846C34000A4EE553CA6E295EA67EDD4F737684706BFF0C516890FD9F504E86FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "活用它们3只的这些长处，\n应该就能泡出理想的茶！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D3B75285B834EEC003353EA76848FD94E9B957F5904FF0C000A5E948BE55C3180FD6CE151FA740660F376848336FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是捉到了花椰猴它们这3只宝可梦，\n就请借给我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F634952304E8682B1693073345B834EEC8FD9003353EA5B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A5C318BF7501F7ED962115427FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等我泡出理想的茶，\n会第一个请你喝的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4962116CE151FA740660F376848336FF0C000A4F1A7B2C4E004E2A8BF74F60559D7684FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花椰猴、爆香猴和冷水猴，\n它们喜欢行道树之类的高处。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是捉到它们了，请把3只都\n加入同行队伍带到这里来吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82B1693073343001720699997334548C51B76C347334FF0C000A5B834EEC559C6B22884C905368114E4B7C7B76849AD85904300200100001BE01000A8981662F634952305B834EEC4E86FF0C8BF7628A003353EA90FD000A52A05165540C884C961F4F0D5E2652308FD991CC67655427300200100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！那不就是\n花椰猴、爆香猴和冷水猴吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF0190A34E0D5C31662F000A82B1693073343001720699997334548C51B76C3473345417FF1F00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太感谢你了！\n那我这就行动起来。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n麻烦你稍等一下！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A611F8C224F604E86FF01000A90A362118FD95C31884C52A88D776765300200100001BE00000A9EBB70E64F607A0D7B494E004E0BFF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "久等了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E457B494E86FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花椰猴、爆香猴、冷水猴茶，\n重新取名为“三辕茶”！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n毕竟花椰猴、爆香猴、冷水猴茶太长了，\n而且容易搞不清顺序……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82B1693073343001720699997334300151B76C3473348336FF0C000A91CD65B053D6540D4E3A201C4E098F958336201DFF0100100001BE01000A6BD57ADF82B1693073343001720699997334300151B76C3473348336592A957F4E86FF0C000A800C4E145BB96613641E4E0D6E05987A5E8F2026202600100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，客人请！\n尝尝这杯初泡香茗吧……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C5BA24EBA8BF7FF01000A5C1D5C1D8FD9676F521D6CE199998317542720262026FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何？\n堪称风味、香味、营养绝佳吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF1F000A582A79F098CE547330019999547330018425517B7EDD4F735427FF1F00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！差点忘了\n把宝可梦们还给你。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF015DEE70B95FD84E86000A628A5B9D53EF68A64EEC8FD87ED94F60300200100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你都借给我花椰猴、爆香猴和冷水猴\n这3只宝可梦了，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我要把三辕茶加入固定菜单！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6090FD501F7ED9621182B1693073343001720699997334548C51B76C347334000A8FD9003353EA5B9D53EF68A64E86FF0C00100001BE00000A62118981628A4E098F95833652A0516556FA5B9A83DC5355FF0100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
